{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThe real ref-backed reconcile-check continuity test exposed that Mode inherits str. functools.total_ordering does not replace rich comparison methods inherited from str, so Mode.__gt__ remains lexical instead of rank-based. As a result Mode.BOOTSTRAP_THROTTLE > Mode.RECONCILE_CHECK is false and check_phase_gate fails to block higher modes when the stored gate is reconcile-check.\n\n## Approach\n- Make every Mode rich comparison use the existing _ORDERED rank contract instead of inherited string lexical ordering.\n- Preserve equality, enum values, MODE_CAPS, from_str, and the five-mode ordering.\n- Extend the existing mode contract tests to exercise natural operators across the full five-mode order.\n- Reuse the real ref-backed test on parent 2c87 to prove reconcile-check blocks a higher mode while allowing the equal target.\n\n## Testing\nRun the focused mode and advisory-lock suites, then `make lint`, `make typecheck`, and `make test`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Mode rich comparisons follow reconcile-check < dry-run < bootstrap-strict < bootstrap-throttle < live for all operators.\n- [x] The real ref-backed reconcile-check gate round trip blocks bootstrap-throttle and allows reconcile-check.\n- [x] Existing mode strings, MODE_CAPS, from_str behavior, and legacy comparisons remain unchanged.\n- [x] Focused tests, `make lint`, `make typecheck`, and `make test` pass.\n\n## Compatibility and rollback\nThis repairs the advertised rank semantics without changing persisted values or vocabulary. Reverting restores the lexical-comparison defect but does not require data migration."}},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1786155225300314001,"uuid":"7ae50fe4-9195-4daa-ac74-4a8d6d1aa661"}